fixture dash_jump_press_on_dash_frame_1_waits
doc BUILD.md s5 Dash-jump "frames 5 to 9" and Jump buffer "8 f" (ADR-0010, Dash-jump, early press): jump and dash pressed together on the dash's frame 1; the jump is not eaten by the dash, waits 4 frames in the buffer and fires as a dash-jump on dash frame 5 (tick 4).
room test/flat
frames 30
input
  0 R dash jump
  1..9 R
end
expect
  at 3 state=dash event.jump=0
  at 4 event.jump=1 vx=5120 state=air
end
